+- Since 2026-10-13-stand-contrast-harness the stand's controls carry a measured SC 1.4.3 reading. blitz-test-harness's `Harness::text_contrast` (read-only: no mutation, input, pump or settle) takes the text-bearing element — a text input itself, else the parent element of the first non-whitespace text node under the node —, its computed `color`, `font-size` and `font-weight`, and the background behind it: each ancestor's `background-color` composited source-over down to the first opaque layer, else the root-else-`body` canvas over opaque white; it reads `None` where an element on that walk has `opacity` below 1, a non-empty `filter` or a `background-image` layer. `contrast_ratio` is the WCAG 2.x ratio over the `color` crate's relative luminance (Chrome's `GetContrastRatio`, blitz-paint's helper restated, blitz-paint untouched), and `TextContrast::required_ratio` asks 3.0 of large text (at least 24 px, or 14 pt at weight 700 or more) and 4.5 of other text. The stand check `stand_contrast` records one row per `controls(task)` row over the four lean tasks at boot (800 × 600 · scale 1 · Light · DejaVu Sans · offline), identical in both layout modes — 18 rows: pass 9 (`back-btn` ×4, `#333333` on `#f0f0f0`, 11.09; `flight-return` 9.33; `flight-start` 17.40; `crud-filter`, `crud-name` and `crud-surname`, `#000000` on `#ffffff`, 21.00), fail 5 (`counter-increment`, `flight-one-way` — the active toggle at boot —, `flight-book`, `timer-reset` and `crud-create`, each `#ffffff` on the accent `#4a6cf7` at 4.39 against 4.5), exempt-inactive 3 (`flight-return-date`, `crud-update` and `crud-delete`, exactly the rows whose snapshot `enabled` is `Some(false)`), no-text 1 (`timer-duration`, the range input). No text is large, so every threshold is 4.5; no measured colour differs from its declared value, and the painted pixel matches the measured background within 1 per channel on all 17 measured rows. SC 1.4.3 is therefore not met on the stand's five accent buttons. The check records and gates nothing; it runs in the workspace `test` leg and per package, not in the `a11y` leg. The re-colouring, the colour-changing states not measured (hover and active, the toggle's other position, an invalid date, the non-boot enabled states), the CRUD list rows and the text outside the controls are owned by the route entry "Stand a11y assertions" (packages/blitz-test-harness/src/contrast.rs:13-23; packages/blitz-test-harness/src/contrast.rs:25-41; packages/blitz-test-harness/src/contrast.rs:56-91; packages/blitz-test-harness/src/contrast.rs:121-147; tests/blitz-tests/tests/stand_contrast.rs:41-129; tests/blitz-tests/tests/stand_contrast.rs:194-225; tests/blitz-tests/tests/stand_contrast.rs:227-277 — as measured at escher-0.1.0/chunks/2026-10-13-stand-contrast-harness/report.md and its evidence/pairs.md)
